{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop planets to combine them. If they go over the limit, you lose and they explode!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861560/extras/301eb383821585a604a9b59b6e71badc.poster.avif?t=1756382903\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861560/extras/301eb383821585a604a9b59b6e71badc.webm?t=1756382903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861560/extras/301eb383821585a604a9b59b6e71badc.mp4?t=1756382903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to reset, then create a black hole (which also forms after you combine two suns). However, if you use this ability it will half your points and it only works once a game so choose when to use it carefully.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861560/extras/96a56e5d6c28067f638b5a11275a1739.poster.avif?t=1756382903\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861560/extras/96a56e5d6c28067f638b5a11275a1739.webm?t=1756382903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861560/extras/96a56e5d6c28067f638b5a11275a1739.mp4?t=1756382903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To get extra points, try to chain multiple planet combinations together to get a combo bonus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861560/extras/dd57a2a15630f22ed3d86ab62b9da610.poster.avif?t=1756382903\" width=722 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861560/extras/dd57a2a15630f22ed3d86ab62b9da610.webm?t=1756382903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861560/extras/dd57a2a15630f22ed3d86ab62b9da610.mp4?t=1756382903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's a total of 4 abilities at your disposal. Another example, is the lightning, which destroys any planet it strikes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861560/extras/336b04ee7a19184fe0c025319e00a844.poster.avif?t=1756382903\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861560/extras/336b04ee7a19184fe0c025319e00a844.webm?t=1756382903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861560/extras/336b04ee7a19184fe0c025319e00a844.mp4?t=1756382903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Black Hole","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3861560/f1c945099b4884f14cba67a4cb5a1df462bc0905.jpg"},{"name":"(Inter)Stellar Combo","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3861560/ae72386bac2956d04e8753b0ea506a033cdc14b7.jpg"},{"name":"1,000 Points!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3861560/5549639b9b106c72acd1cfc45cf926d504bf1d51.jpg"},{"name":"10,000 Points!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3861560/eee3023ceb43a90dd009af924f9a7abffb3b25b9.jpg"},{"name":"100,000 Points!","path":"https://